        <div class="hero-icon red">📡</div>
        <div>
          <h1>Go-live & Upload Alerts</h1>
          <p>Post when a Twitch channel goes live or a YouTube channel uploads — with your own message, embed and ping.</p>
          <div class="hero-status" id="alertsStatus"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-toggle"><span class="muted" style="font-size:0.85rem;">Enabled</span><%- moduleToggle('alerts', config.socialAlertsEnabled !== false, null) %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" id="twitchSetupNote" style="display:none; border-color:var(--c-yellow);">
