        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.88rem; margin-bottom:0;">
          Create a free app at <a href="https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dev.twitch.tv/console/apps</a>
          (OAuth redirect: <code>http://localhost</code>, category: Chat Bot), then add <code>TWITCH_CLIENT_ID</code> and
          <code>TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET</code> to your Render environment. YouTube alerts work without any setup.
